    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93043be82b9d8335bba45e7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa590602b03384649277b084cd36d881d4f24707abf056fd0a939443d6e5c4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:789d0707699db4429f7cf52c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太可惜了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac481eee49477008b7172daa4cc10a97097b8b8dd58bdeabcc0747f23bc2cf56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2711a0ef397eea77b3b889b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天记得来领取这个哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a932aec68a1ad50ae4894e70d9c8b64a8285c9973440713776e562d9080484f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeef34a34d6118fc74da3432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经没有力气啦……\r\n讨厌讨厌，今天要休息了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5467a4464ca38605da2016dfc632b909b25192c163fa52806d6be0eb126683bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba12fcf5cbae106e07acb3ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "累了还强撑可不行。\r\n对吧~~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb4b388582ed68dbaed0f784f990f7ec53f8674dcd9992c5f715d172beaa9c6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b89b444347237961d07cbd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来训练吧，快点快点！\r\n要让你看到比昨天更厉害的我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3642aa97669ed9bf181f2898fe446c79305219d3ba60d59c74daed351abc66a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c79125db7c41bce123860f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断变强，\r\n然后『GO☆』地前往迪拜吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f5ad05a3bda0a021f1db28f4ea0a3b871249ef3c51fe40d199b850d557ccc66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f28b47013663a286d73822f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随意看看吧！\r\n现在可是有大福利等着哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "719b9a33a38609a7fd8832472119a609adcf723d5579dfe8c846e61e99581f47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:288ecf838a05fdf539beccf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在精神满满！\r\n大概是因为有按照训练员亲说的，\r\n好好地吃过饭了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a3664491eb0e6435b57982bb268b591aa324cc38c437b0956394db6237eca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb40310b9a538eef9e148586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等下会怎么表扬我呢~？\r\n我很期待哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4415a8df27fd4ce417ee5dfecd35b2aec441ec3cfa898da94926b5892e35bb35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:635edc4f456f3e21d6598123",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我身上的优点，\r\n真希望能不断地发挥出来啊——♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3871e828f5169de1d2bdb2678556d4a958ddb50d46878f5e6d239f806cea9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71879aff0b0ba88d7ddd0985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练要是能\r\n不那么累就好了啊……\r\n……不行吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "25b9c35a86dc500e8486b0158b6e61d874409344eb109f4712b1caddfa16046f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7704e30c64d4e2762a1bc0d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我再休息一下吧~……\r\n就差一点点啦~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5981cd6c491d74aa6362d196e12cf5a7698abdf32c6f4e1ec89865469ebacabf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e668da994b6a17cf5905db97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……\r\n现在没法那么努力，大概……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a37e5b373484b0911a2e49e37b0a31112cb21e6eddc3d3ba50f1bc83638cace",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec35031ed8f299d556232052",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然知道必须要做了……\r\n……那现在就做不行吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13c49fe80ac45617bb37b9f67e76ff28200e12b43262b01585ce84fa0d208932",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e302e43118d804cf6562330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是能听听我全~部的愿望的话，\r\n要参赛倒也行……嗯~~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb9f6f8c05bd4c87a5b6a93ab3e110a4c622a1e22863251e5f2aa4a61c2002b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4838406c154355b4daec774f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶~已经没法再参赛啦~……\r\n好难受啊~……\r\n都累的不行啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db8610e55094c7ad4160a9eb77b44a4dbfa5c8cc6b8c3e3a75c1ddfb0fc31f69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c6427b5adaf38a062e18c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我，超——快的！\r\n绝对不要错过哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74b311ad58dd77bb5d2eca50fc0168b705e4ea608d318ef4566631ca224a51c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7838ae2a7388f56a1735de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态很棒！\r\n要是还有训练员亲应援的话\r\n就完美了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24adddbb37d6b618fddecad953072268454f3b0f527ca048cbfb058e9eb7a366",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53476e76e221de88f2304663",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀模式全开，要上了☆\r\n目标是成为名流！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20bebe1f949ef8c53477e2bac93af3c6e4ff04277f85204316eb7d506d0d2bfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84ddfefcea9531f584887f8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "砰砰地感觉能赢☆\r\n精神满满地上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8c3e3f69dc40b3269b1345c9ab5cae35dc0ff0429fd6f473cc2242b6869b538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac40a78b3768e6b8364e53b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员亲一起努力的成果，\r\n我会全部发挥出来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d51a590d8bf1241d535a3b499018c72969e17022ce155596c0521f9d96d9400",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63888724037d955ee3cc0f58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了的话粉丝又要增加了！\r\n呀~要怎么办呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5190177190227d8da0060ff75c125978f38ec936427b8d4f5b9fb6b9d8e9ad3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8c07ac8db62991ffde380f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是迈向名流的第一步！\r\n今天也要加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c05df07141ea3ae8c011abbc6eaedecbd4f647c254fef22e70b01dc54745adbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a5558e6b2e764af252cb10c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也感觉很好☆\r\n既然会被看到的话，\r\n果然还是想展现出我的可爱啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f4189986f35207b520eecf0265ed04bb61967566e680e7c67df57f2dfb6137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fde34e975aeab02e26b37b7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，没关系的。\r\n比赛我可是很拿手的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6427b60fce0aeabd9582867247cb608252bcdbe660b4388adb816a43480783b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:458706f8438f321409f295f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉有点微妙~……\r\n嗯，没关系。\r\n训练员亲会看着的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa6e06daa14922e552a69a92e7d5be83b48a8f2e338bc0143ff49a1fb88c585",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9612ad7b801c5e6d51223f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以模仿一下我说的话吗？\r\n『强击妹妹真可爱♡』\r\n……嗯，这样我就更有精神了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a89853ba4f3ef6ae2aefd0dbe900e46501c90564b402d58f58b890ab1219f2c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae983ca4ad81f1f16fa2395",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果没有容光焕发的精神的话，\r\n也就没法成为名流了。\r\n笑容，要有笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8987234a4e6b2706ebb0b71f572c3370778fe23eda3f0fa694fdd4990b7b0c7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1afdc28d41749604acb960b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应该……没问题吧？\r\n毕竟都和训练员亲一起努力过了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "646ea041e9e85c3c2ac06ec5921842e6008b54fa0fd4ff1d2b18f0fbda0a4ec2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebf209e4884e00ac2bb53564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……比赛结束后可以夸夸我吗？\r\n这样的话我想我就能继续努力了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29369f0bae90f00da41c26e02f133e08678aa83f864b8647a99abe67250e944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9520e1283ba1f3e744bae88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛我绝对要获胜……\r\n要是输了可就没法成为名流了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e3f0fcf7dc263b8b716cd0f0e0f036e27bfd0e8de5b4c694e5eeab4295f8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d244f307d8820b9d4a62e25f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b45c5021c51050d5dfc664eefc04d795ec85bdaa386e291e2b0ddd9b9d55142",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "20038"
      ]
    }
  ]
